    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 · A customer buys something\nThe storefront POSTs the cart here at checkout.\n\n**The seller** gets the order with the customer's number.\n**The customer** gets a confirmation with the order number — but only if they left a phone number.\n**You** get nothing, on purpose. You are not in the middle of their sales.\n\n24 hours later the flow checks the sheet again: if the row is still `new`, the seller gets one nudge. Change the row to `done` in the sheet and the nudge never fires.",
        "width": 540,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-3759",
      "name": "Note 3759",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Money never passes through here\nThe seller takes payment from their customer directly. You charge the seller a monthly fee, and nothing else.\n\nThat is what makes this whole system legal to run without a payment licence — and what the FAQ on the site promises.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 260,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "note-3029",
      "name": "Note 3029",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
